caption: Destruction and Recoalescence

Wraiths interact with other shadow realm beings normally, and so can take damage and “die”, though with Unkillable 3, this is not a permanent death, but the Wraith does feel the inexorable pull of the cosmic force of Death. Every time a Wraith must recover from being reduced to -10xHP, they must roll to resist oblivion, per the rules above. If they survive, they reform in the dark umbra near one of their fetters.
